    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>scale the empathy back a bit. it feels like you're just giving me a script. i'm not looking for a pep talk, i'm looking for an answer. if there really is nothing—if we're just accidental atoms spinning in a void that doesn't care if we exist or not—then isn't the struggle itself just... a mistake? like, why am i fighting so hard to stay in a room that's completely empty?",
